notes.body:
Where there are two conditions that returns one message, should it be split into two tests with unique messages or is that too much hand holding?  
```
    if (offset > tvbr->len || (len + offset) > tvbr->len) {
        luaL_error(L,"Range is out of bounds");
        return 0;
    }
```

